{{zone|The Garden}} is an island where players can [[Farming|farm]]. It is similar to the [[Private Island]] in that each player has their own and they can build on it. The player must be {{SkyBlock Level|5}} to access '''The Garden'''.

== Mechanics ==
=== Levels ===
'''The Garden''' has 15 different levels. Leveling it gives {{SkyBlock XP|10|short=y}} per, unlocks new visitors, barn skins, new crops, crop upgrades and faster {{stat|crop growth}}.
It is leveled up with {{DarkGreen|Garden XP}}, obtained from [[#Garden Milestones|Garden Milestones]] and accepting offers from Visitors.

=== Leveling Rewards ===
{{/Skill UI}}

{{/Leveling Rewards}}
The menu can be accessed with {{Code|/gardenlevels}}, {{Code|/gardenlevelsmenu}} (both of which can only be accessed while on the Garden), or by going to the [[Farming|Farming Skill]] menu, where the icon is located at the bottom of the menu, above the "Go Back" and "Close" buttons. It can only be accessed after the player has visited the Garden at least once.

Unlike [[Skills]], there is no "Level 0", meaning that the player starts at {{Skl|Garden|I}}. Additionally, Level 1 is automatically unlocked when visiting the Garden for the first time after it is unlocked (reaching SkyBlock Level 5). Also, there are only 15 levels ({{Skl|Garden|I}} – {{Skl|Garden|XV}}).

=== Crops ===
Different crops can be grown and harvested in {{zone|The Garden}}, but require a '''Garden''' level to be unlocked. Nether Wart and Mushroom growth speed is also increased in the Garden, on top of the increase in growth speed gained by the '''Garden''' level.

