=== Visitors ===
{{Main|Garden Visitors}}
'''Visitors''' are [[NPC]]s across [[SkyBlock]] that occasionally visit the [[player]]'s '''Garden'''. The player will receive an offer from them. Offers can be accepted or declined.

Visitors will stay in the Garden until the player accepts or declines their offer. A maximum of {{Green|5}} Visitors can be in the Garden at one time. 

All '''Visitors''' come with a rarity tag. The higher the rarity of a '''Visitor''', the rarer it is to have them visit.
====Requests====
When visiting, '''Visitors''' will request varying amounts of certain items. The quantity of the items that a Visitor requests is determined by a base number of items, the player's {{Skl|Garden}} level, and the visitor's rarity.

==== Rewards ====
'''Visitors''' offer {{skl|farming|XP}}, {{skl|garden|XP}}, {{Copper}}, {{Bits}}, and sometimes other unique rewards to the player if they accept the visitor's request. 

All '''Visitors''' also have a chance to give one of the following items:
*{{Item|Hypercharge Chip}} ({{Green|3%}})
*{{Item|Quickdraw Chip}} ({{Green|3%}})
*{{Item|Flowering Bouquet}} ({{Green|2%}})
*{{Item|Overgrown Grass}} ({{Green|0.1%}})
*{{Item|Green Bandana}} ({{Green|0.4%}}, {{Rarity|r|nolink=y}} '''Visitors''' and above only)

==== Visitor's Logbook ====
{{Main|Garden Visitors}}
The '''Visitor's Logbook''' keeps track of who has visited the player's '''Garden''', and requirements for NPCs to visit.

== SkyMart ==
'''SkyMart''' is a shop accessible through the [[#The Desk|Desk]]. It allows the player to purchase Farming-related [[Equipment]], [[Tools]], [[Barn Skins]] and more. Most of the items are purchased with {{Copper}}, but {{c}} and {{Gems}} are also used as currencies.

{{:SkyMart/UI}}

=== Garden Milestones ===
{{Skl|Farming}} Experience obtained from Garden Milestones is not affected by {{stat|Farming Wisdom}}.

==== Crop Milestones ====
'''Crop Milestones''' can be reached by harvesting certain amounts of crops. When milestones are reached, they grant {{Skl|Garden|XP}}, {{Skl|Farming|XP}}, and {{SkyBlock XP}}. Crop Milestones can only be leveled up while farming on The Garden. Any crops broken outside The Garden will not count towards this milestone (Private Island, Barn, etc.). Additionally crops farmed by any means that are not the player do not count towards Crop Milestones even though they still count towards [[Collections|Collection]] progress.

'''Crop Milestones''' have 46 tiers per crop. Your progress towards tier 46 on a specific crop will be shown once you reach tier 20 in that crop.

{{Tabview|-|/Crop Milestones|button=Show Crop Milestones}}

==== Visitor Milestones ====
There are 2 types of '''Visitor Milestones''':
*'''Unique [[#Visitors|Visitors]] Served''', which increases based on the amount of offers from unique Visitors the player has accepted. This functionally maxes out at tier 17.
*'''Offers Accepted''', which increases based on the amount of offers from Visitors the player has accepted
Both grant {{Skl|Garden|XP}}, {{Skl|Farming|XP}}, and {{SkyBlock XP}} when milestones are reached.

